        "nobel_worthiness": "Aberration correction transformed electron microscopy, allowing atomic-scale imaging and spectroscopy that changed how materials can be studied.",
        "attribution": "Rose's optical concepts and the instrument-building and implementation work of Haider and Krivanek form a persuasive set of complementary contributions.",
        "maturity": "The advance is mature, widely adopted, and repeatedly validated across materials and instruments.",
